# accept these on key rollover. When Arduino rotates a key, the operator
# verifies the new fingerprint out-of-band (against the key published at
# https://apt-repo.arduino.cc/arduino.asc and Arduino's security
# announcements) and appends it here via
# `yoe update-feeds --allow-key-update=<fpr>` or by editing this file
# directly.
#
# Format: one fingerprint per line, no whitespace, no spaces in the
# fingerprint itself. Lines starting with # are comments.

